summary.label:
1. Monitor various body indicators during sleep, CIRCUL RING will monitor heart rate, sleep stage, night body temperature and other indicators in real time when you sleep, you can easily know the sleep status of each night, and provide personalized tips to help you adjust your physical state;
2. Monitor daily activity data around the clock, record your daily heart rate, steps, calories, exercise time, etc., and provide personalized prompts;
3. A quick overview of the changes in health indicators, rising or falling over time, and the trend of daily, weekly, and monthly changes at a glance;
4. Professional sports details record, including heart rate, step count and other detailed data, data charts, etc.

*Disclaimer:
This app is not a medical app, and all health-related data, results, recommendations, etc. are for reference only, not for medical purposes.
The ring product connected to the application is not a medical device and cannot provide any medical services, if you feel unwell, please consult a medical institution in time.
